IfcOpenShell (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
--------------------------------
The Windows installer bundles IfcOpenShell, which is licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 3 or later.

- Licence text: the LGPL-3.0 text is in the LICENSES folder next to this file
  (LICENSES/LGPL-3.0.txt). The GPL-3.0 text is in the LICENSE file.
- Corresponding source: IfcOpenShell is not modified by this project. Its source
  code is available from https://github.com/IfcOpenShell/IfcOpenShell and from
  the source distribution of the same version on https://pypi.org/project/ifcopenshell/.
  The version in use is shown in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and in the
  ifcopenshell-*.dist-info folder of the installed Python. If you cannot
  obtain it from those places, open an issue at
  https://github.com/Sam-AEC/aec-model-bridge/issues and we will help.
- Replacing the library: IfcOpenShell is installed as ordinary Python files in
  the bundled Python (python\Lib\site-packages\ifcopenshell), not compiled into
  an executable. You can replace it with a modified or newer version, for
  example with "python.exe -m pip install --upgrade ifcopenshell" using the
  python.exe in the install folder.

